-## Current flow
-
-```mermaid
-flowchart LR
-  P[device / phone socket] --> L[listen: live STT]
-  W[WAL / SD / desktop / mobile batch] --> S[backend-sync / backend-sync-backfill]
-  L -->|request_finalization; dispatch mode unset = inline| PU[pusher: utils/pusher_finalization.py]
